OL,3,APhilippines police ask prosecutors to
OL,4,Acharge Thomas Markle over child sex
OL,5,Aabuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in the Philippines have asked
OL,8,Fprosecutors to charge Thomas Markle Sr,
OL,9,Fthe father of Meghan, Duchess of
OL,10,FSussex, with possession of and intent
OL,11,Fto distribute child sexual abuse
OL,12,Fmaterial.
OL,14,FCebu province prosecutor Graeme Elmido
OL,15,Ftold the BBC that police had filed
OL,16,Fdocuments requesting that Markle be
OL,17,Fcharged on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
