OL,3,APhilippines police ask prosecutors to
OL,4,Acharge Thomas Markle over child sex
OL,5,Aabuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this month, Markle, 82, was
OL,8,Fseparately arrested and charged in the
OL,9,FUS with possession of child sexual
OL,10,Fabuse material. The FBI said agents
OL,11,Fseized about 78 items, including film
OL,12,Fnegatives, slides and books that they
OL,13,Fallege contained child sex abuse
OL,14,Fmaterial, from storage units Markle
OL,15,Frented.
OL,17,FMarkle, who is in custody in the US,
OL,18,Fhas previously denied the allegations.
OL,19,FThe BBC has contacted Markle's attorney
OL,20,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
